# Constitution invariants

Read `CONSTITUTION.md` before any patch. Violations are INVALID.

- Renderer: Three.js only. No Babylon.js, PlayCanvas, Phaser 3D.
- Physics: `THREE.Box3` / `Sphere` / `Raycaster` only. No Cannon.js, Ammo.js, Rapier.
- UI is HTML/CSS inside `#ui-root`. Engine/logic must not write the DOM.
- UI ↔ 3D communication only via EventBus (`src/core/EventBus.js`).
- Motion, AI, ballistics, and particles use `THREE.Clock` delta. No 60 Hz hardcoded steps.
- Dispose every `BufferGeometry`, `Material`, and `Texture` on unload/restart.

Do not invent EventBus topics or REST/WS fields without updating `CONTRACTS.md`.
